 "_comment": "tiny-chat Stage 0 (60m; experiments/tiny_chat_2026-10/PREREGISTRATION.md): the 16% dialogue mix (E1 level; design.json) built on the VM, a 300-step throughput probe per shape alone on the GPU, then lr screens [0.0005, 0.001, 0.002] x 1500 steps per shape (seed 101), three at a time. Estimated 12.4 job-hours. Brings home one summary.json per job. Afterwards, at home: python tools/colab_chat/tiny_chat_run.py choose --art ART --out experiments/tiny_chat_2026-10/stage0/lr_choice.json, commit, rerun make_jobs.py. Upload vocab_llama3_bpe.gguf with the runner's --upload. Dialogue levels [0, 4, 8, 16]% (copies), E1 at 16% PROVISIONAL (design.json not final: the gate job refuses; rerun make_jobs.py --dialogue-pt-bytes once the whole default human set is measured).",
